{
  "name": "Chatwoot RAG agent (Qdrant + Postgres memory) with handoff",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chatwoot RAG agent (original)\nSame handoff contract as `chatwoot-ai-support-agent`, but the knowledge base is a **Qdrant** collection (fill it with `chatwoot-kb-ingest-qdrant`) and memory lives in **Postgres**, both from the n8n self-hosted AI starter kit.\nSwap the OpenAI model/embeddings for Ollama nodes to run fully local.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "22a92e66-e05b-52ea-8f1e-4106a239a35a",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
